# What never needs to reach a serverless bundle.
#
# The lambda has a size limit and a cold start proportional to what is in it,
# and everything below is either rebuilt by Vercel, useless without a writable
# disk, or candidate PII that has no business being deployed at all.

# Rebuilt from requirements.txt on Vercel's own Linux. 83MB locally, and the
# wrong platform's wheels besides.
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local secrets. Vercel's own environment variables are the deployed config --
# see the README. .env.example is documentation and is not needed at runtime.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Written at runtime, and unwritable on Vercel anyway.
logs/
state/

# Candidate PII: portal exports, and the reminder/ingest CSVs beside them.
*.csv

# Not served, not imported.
tests/
tools/
.github/
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
PROJECT_AUDIT.md

# assessments/ IS NOT LISTED. It is 481K, and rubric_pack reads the grids out
# of it -- the review surface renders criterion labels from the same pack the
# grading used. Excluding it is a page that half-draws.
